# Secrets only. NOT a blanket `.env*`, which the Vercel CLI appends on
# `env add`: that pattern also matches .env.example, the one env file that is
# meant to be committed and is a new contributor's only guide to what the app
# needs. The specific patterns above already cover every real secret file.

# Agent tooling installed as a side effect of `vercel integration add neon`,
# not authored here and not part of the product. Tool-specific, so a
# contributor using anything else gets nothing from it.
